      "evidence": "template/scripts/lifecycle_workers.py:795-796 is unchanged. `comments_for` calls `_gh_json('api','--paginate', .../comments?per_page=100)`, which uses `_decode_all` (lines ~727-741). An empty body is decoded as 'null' and returns None instead of failing with a comment-history acquisition error. Non-object rows, rows without an integer id and non-increasing ids are not checked. The result is passed straight into `derive_candidate`/`i_won` claim replay in `work_next` (lines 507 and 522). Neither design.md nor tasks.md scopes this reader out.",
